===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, relating to, or suggestive of [[war#Noun|war]]; [[warlike]].
#* {{RQ:Dryden Annus Mirabilis|stanza=12|page=4|passage=But peaceful Kings, o'r '''martial''' people ſet, / Each others poize and counter-ballance are.}}
# Connected with or relating to [[armed forces]] or the [[profession]] of [[arm#Noun|arms]] or [[military#Adjective|military]] [[life]].
#* {{quote-book|author=Xavier Herbert|authorlink=Xavier Herbert|chapter=Dawn of a New Era|title=[[w:Capricornia (novel)|Capricornia]]|location=Sydney, N.S.W.|publisher={{w|Angus & Robertson}}|year=1938|oclc=220342066|location2=New York, N.Y.|publisher2=[[w:Appleton-Century-Crofts|D. Appleton-Century]]|year2=1943|page2=194|pageurl2=https://archive.org/details/capricornianovel00herb/page/194/mode/1up|oclc2=462159385|passage=He was lying on the table with head pillowed on the broken concertina and body sheltered with the Federal Flag, looking like a '''martial''' corpse. He did not wake properly till Blossom dragged him to the tap outside and turned the water on him.|lang=en}}
# Characteristic of or befitting a [[warrior]]; having a military [[bearing#Noun|bearing]]; [[soldierly]].
#: {{synonyms|en|soldierlike|warriorlike}}
# {{lb|en|astrology|obsolete}} Pertaining to the [[astrological]] [[influence#Noun|influence]] of the [[planet]] [[Mars]].
# {{lb|en|astronomy|obsolete}} Of or relating to the planet Mars; [[Martian#Adjective|Martian]].
# {{lb|en|chemistry|medicine|obsolete}} Containing, or relating to, [[iron#Noun|iron]] (which was [[symbolically]] associated with the planet Mars by [[alchemist]]s); [[chalybeate]], [[ferric]], [[ferrous]].
#: {{ux|en|'''martial''' preparations&emsp;'''martial''' flowers (a reddish crystalline salt of iron)}}

